### Create a coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "code": "SUMMER20",
  "status": "active",
  "discount_type": "percentage",
  "reason": "Summer sale",
  "client_id": 1,
  "valid_until": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Get a coupon by code
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons/SUMMER20
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List coupons
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Deactivate a coupon
PUT {{baseUrl}}/coupons/SUMMER20/deactivate
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
